Inline HTML in prose: [B]bold[/B], [B]strong[/B], [I]italic[/I], [I]em[/I], [U]underline[/U], [U]ins[/U], [S]s[/S], [S]del[/S], [S]strike[/S], [SUP]sup[/SUP], [SUB]sub[/SUB], [MARK]mark[/MARK], [ICODE]Ctrl[/ICODE]+[ICODE]C[/ICODE], [ICODE]code[/ICODE].

Mixed with markdown: [B]bold with [I]italic[/I] inside[/B] and [B]bold with [I]html italic[/I] inside[/B].

Links and images: [URL=https://example.com]link[/URL], [JUMPTO=section]jump[/JUMPTO], [ANAME=section]target[/ANAME], [ANAME=other]id target[/ANAME], [EMAIL]me@example.com[/EMAIL], [IMG alt="alt text"]https://example.com/a.png[/IMG], [IMG]https://example.com/b.png[/IMG], [IMG alt="svg"]https://images.weserv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fexample.com%2Fc.svg&output=png[/IMG], <img alt="no src">.

Abbr: [ABBR="World Health Organization"]WHO[/ABBR] and <abbr>no title</abbr>.

Fonts: [COLOR=red][SIZE=3][FONT=Times New Roman]font tag[/FONT][/SIZE][/COLOR], bad values, [COLOR=#f00][SIZE=12px][FONT=Arial][S][U][B][I]styled span[/I][/B][/U][/S][/FONT][/SIZE][/COLOR], [B]weight 700[/B], [COLOR=rgb(1, 2, 3)]important[/COLOR], plain span.

Mis-nested: [B][I]bold italic[/I][/B] end.

Stray closers: before  after, before </custom> after.

Unknown: <custom-tag data-x="1">[B]Bold[/B]</custom-tag> and <iframe src="x.html"></iframe>.

Media: [URL=x.mp4]x.mp4[/URL], [URL=x.ogg]x.ogg[/URL], but <video controls><source src="y.mp4"></video>.

Entities inside HTML: &lt; and ©, in code: [ICODE]&amp;lt;[/ICODE].

Comment inline: before  after.

Code span containing HTML: [ICODE]<font color="red">Code</font>[/ICODE] stays literal.
